.u15.d5.n","locale":"en-US","text":"When is your birthday?"},"skillIds":["speaking","u15.dialogue"],"type":"dialogueTurn","vocabularyIds":["u15.birthday"]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"Linh"},{"id":"c2","text":"Her mother"},{"id":"c3","text":"Tom"}],"passage":"Saturday is Mai's birthday. Her friends want to celebrate, but it is a secret. Mai is a little sad because nobody says \"Happy birthday\" in the morning. She is bored at home. In the evening, Linh calls her: \"Come to the café, please.\" When Mai arrives, all her friends are there: Nam, Tom, Anna and Mr. Long. \"Surprise!\" they shout. Mai is very surprised and happy. Nam is funny and dances on a chair. Mrs. Rosa brings a big cake. \"Thank you for inviting me to my own party!\" Mai laughs.","question":"Who calls Mai in the evening?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"Linh\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c1","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Bữa tiệc bất ngờ\".","id":"u15n7l1-e09","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"Who calls Mai in the evening?"},"skillIds":["reading","u15.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","imageAssetId":"i.u8.spring","text":"spring"},{"id":"c2","imageAssetId":"i.u10.park","text":"park"},{"id":"c3","imageAssetId":"i.u10.city","text":"city"},{"id":"c4","imageAssetId":"i.u15.birthday","text":"birthday"}]},"explanation":"\"birthday\" = \"sinh nhật\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c4","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"sinh nhật\" là \"birthday\".","id":"u15n7l1-e10","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Hình nào là \"sinh nhật\"?"},"skillIds":["u15.vocab"],"type":"imageChoice","vocabularyIds":["u15.birthday"]},{"content":{"pairs":[{"id":"p1","left":{"id":"p1l","text":"angry"},"right":{"id":"p1r","text":"tức giận"}},{"id":"p2","left":{"id":"p2l","text":"invite"},"right":{"id":"p2r","text":"mời"}},{"id":"p3","left":{"id":